 * Mounting: the chip sits on the PCB bottom, its (x, y, z) axes are the robot's (left, forward, down).
 * Every reading is returned in the robot body frame of the Onshape/URDF "imu" frame instead:
 * x forward, y left, z up (accelerometer: +g on z when level, specific force).
